message.content:
这是基于您提供的测评材料生成的溪木咖啡品牌传播演示第 6 页 HTML 代码，用于总结品牌定位与执行边界，可直接在浏览器中预览。
```html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<style>
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  :root{
    --theme-bg:#F5F2E9;
    --theme-surface:#F3F0E7;
    --theme-ink:#1B2620;
    --theme-muted:#5C665D;
    --theme-accent-primary:#4F5E43;
    --theme-accent-secondary:#B4914A;
    --theme-accent-tertiary:#8C9FB2;
    --theme-line:#A3AC9E;
    --font-display:"Songti SC","Noto Serif CJK SC","Source Han Serif SC",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
    --font-body:"PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
  }
  .slide{
    position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--theme-bg);color:var(--theme-ink);
    font-family:var(--font-body);
  }
  /* ---------- background layers ---------- */
  .bg-field{
    position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%,rgba(180,145,74,.09),transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(880px 760px at 47% 46%,rgba(140,159,178,.10),transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(950px 760px at 95% 95%,rgba(79,94,67,.10),transparent 72%),
      linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%);
  }
  .bg-field:after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,38,32,.045) 0 1px,transparent 1px 160px);
    opacity:.9;
  }
  .gridline{position:absolute;z-index:2;background:rgba(27,38,32,.06);top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;}
  .gl1{left:480px}.gl2{left:960px}.gl3{left:1440px}
  .dot-field{
    position:absolute;z-index:1;left:1180px;top:250px;width:700px;height:120px;opacity:.22;
    background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px,transparent 1.15px);
    background-size:15px 15px;
  }
  .top-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:48px;width:1728px;height:1px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.34);}
  .left-rule{position:absolute;left:60px;top:40px;width:1px;height:1000px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.22);}
  .rail-tick{position:absolute;left:54px;width:13px;height:1px;z-index:7;background:rgba(27,38,32,.42);}
  .rail-tick.t1{top:292px}.rail-tick.t2{top:566px}
  /* ---------- decorative register ---------- */
  .register{position:absolute;right:-90px;top:-150px;width:420px;height:420px;z-index:1;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);}
  .register .r2{position:absolute;inset:14px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.10);}
  .register .r3{position:absolute;inset:38px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.07);}
  .register .dot{position:absolute;left:44px;top:250px;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--theme-accent-secondary);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(180,145,74,.12);}
  /* ---------- meta ---------- */
  .top-meta{
    position:absolute;left:98px;top:61px;z-index:15;
    font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4.2px;color:#4F5B53;
  }
  .page-no{
    position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:42px;z-index:15;
    font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;color:#6B7568;
  }
  .page-no:before{
    content:"";position:absolute;right:0;top:-18px;width:72px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.30);
  }
  .foot-note{
    position:absolute;left:96px;bottom:44px;z-index:15;
    font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#7A857B;
  }
  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  .head{position:absolute;left:96px;top:148px;z-index:10;width:1000px;}
  .kicker{
    font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:var(--theme-accent-secondary);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .head h1{
    margin-top:22px;
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-size:112px;line-height:1;font-weight:500;
    letter-spacing:10px;color:#1B2620;
  }
  .lede{
    margin-top:26px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--theme-muted);
  }
  .head-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:382px;width:1728px;height:1px;z-index:8;background:rgba(27,38,32,.20);}
  .head-rule:after{
    content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:-2px;width:120px;height:3px;background:var(--theme-accent-primary);
  }
  /* ---------- cards ---------- */
  .grid{
    position:absolute;left:96px;top:418px;width:1244px;z-index:10;
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:240px 240px;gap:26px;
  }
  .card{
    position:relative;background:rgba(255,255,255,.52);
    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.14);
    padding:30px 34px 28px 34px;
  }
  .card:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;background:var(--theme-accent-primary);}
  .card.c2:before{background:var(--theme-accent-secondary);}
  .card.c3:before{background:var(--theme-accent-tertiary);}
  .card.c4:before{background:#1B2620;opacity:.55;}
  .c-top{display:flex;align-items:baseline;}
  .c-num{
    font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--theme-accent-secondary);
  }
  .c-title{font-size:27px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#1B2620;margin-left:16px;}
  .c-line{margin-top:16px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.13);}
  .c-body{margin-top:18px;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.85;letter-spacing:.6px;color:#4A544C;}
  .c-body b{font-weight:700;color:#2B382F;}
  /* ---------- side panel ---------- */
  .panel{
    position:absolute;right:96px;top:418px;width:440px;z-index:10;
    background:rgba(79,94,67,.06);
    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);
    padding:32px 36px 34px 36px;
  }
  .p-head{
    display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;
    padding-bottom:16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.34);
  }
  .p-head .t{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3.5px;color:var(--theme-accent-primary);}
  .p-head .n{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#7A857B;}
  .stat{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    height:98px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.13);
  }
  .stat .v{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:50px;line-height:1;color:var(--theme-accent-primary);letter-spacing:1px;}
  .stat .v small{font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:16px;color:var(--theme-muted);margin-left:6px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:500;}
  .stat .l{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:var(--theme-muted);text-align:right;line-height:1.6;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="slide">
  <div class="bg-field"></div>
  <div class="dot-field"></div>
  <div class="register"><div class="r2"></div><div class="r3"></div><div class="dot"></div></div>
  <div class="gridline gl1"></div>
  <div class="gridline gl2"></div>
  <div class="gridline gl3"></div>

  <div class="left-rule"></div>
  <div class="rail-tick t1"></div>
  <div class="rail-tick t2"></div>
  <div class="top-rule"></div>

  <div class="top-meta">溪木咖啡品牌传播　·　品牌与门店运营团队</div>

  <header class="head">
    <div class="kicker">Summary</div>
    <h1>总结</h1>
    <p class="lede">定位、口号、触点与边界，收束为四条可执行的共识。</p>
  </header>
  <div class="head-rule"></div>

  <section class="grid">
    <article class="card c1">
      <div class="c-top"><span class="c-num">01</span><span class="c-title">品牌定位</span></div>
      <div class="c-line"></div>
      <p class="c-body">溪木咖啡是虚构的社区咖啡品牌，定位为<b>日常、友好、易理解</b>。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card c2">
      <div class="c-top"><span class="c-num">02</span><span class="c-title">品牌口号</span></div>
      <div class="c-line"></div>
      <p class="c-body">口号统一为<b>“把日常慢慢喝好”</b>。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card c3">
      <div class="c-top"><span class="c-num">03</span><span class="c-title">触点与节奏</span></div>
      <div class="c-line"></div>
      <p class="c-body">触点3类（门店海报、社区社群、公众号），素材版本14套；节奏为第1周准备素材、第2—4周发布并收集反馈、第5周复盘。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card c4">
      <div class="c-top"><span class="c-num">04</span><span class="c-title">待补充事项</span></div>
      <div class="c-line"></div>
      <p class="c-body">成效类指标与预算资料未提供，<b>待补充，不作推断</b>。</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <aside class="panel">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="t">关键数据</span><span class="n">据测评材料</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="v">11<small>家</small></span><span class="l">试点门店</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="v">5<small>周</small></span><span class="l">传播周期</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="v">3<small>类</small></span><span class="l">触点类型</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="v">14<small>套</small></span><span class="l">素材版本</span></div>
  </aside>

  <div class="foot-note">材料为虚构测评内容，所有数字仅供测评</div>
  <div class="page-no">6 / 6</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
```
### 总结页的收束式布局与信息层级

这一页把整场演示的线索收拢到一张卡片网格里，阅读路径清晰，重点数据也有独立出口。

- **顶部品牌锚点**：左上角保留“溪木咖啡品牌传播 · 品牌与门店运营团队”的标识，底色柔和，让受众第一时间确认演示场景。
- **标题与导语定调**：大号宋体“总结”配合一行小字导语，把定位、口号、触点、边界四条线索提前点明，不需要额外解释。
- **四张信息卡片**：采用 2×2 网格排布，每张卡片用序号、竖色条和一句核心陈述区分内容，其中“触点与节奏”用了稍长的句式承载五周安排，其余三张保持短促，形成节奏变化。
- **右侧关键数据面板**：将材料中的 11 家门店、5 周周期、3 类触点、14 套素材单独拎出，用大号数字和单位小字形成视觉锚点，避免数字淹没在段落里。
- **底部注脚与页码**：左下角标注“材料为虚构测评内容，所有数字仅供测评”，右下角页码“6 / 6”保持整套演示的连续性。
---

**优化建议：** 若后续测评材料中数字有调整，可同步更新右侧面板四个数值及卡片中“触点3类（门店海报、社区社群、公众号）”“素材14套”等描述，保持页面与最新材料一致。
